@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
left to right direction

title Wariant 2: Pool na ConcurrentBag<T>

rectangle "Worker Thread" as T
rectangle "TryTake()" as A
rectangle "ConcurrentBag<T>" as B
rectangle "Create new T\n(gdy brak elementu)" as C
rectangle "Use resource" as U
rectangle "Add(Reset(T))" as R

T --> A
A --> B : sukces
A --> C : brak elementu
B --> U
C --> U
U --> R
R --> B

note right of B
Brak globalnego lock.
Nizszy narzut przy
duzej wspolbieznosci.
end note

@enduml
